          "id": "2088cf3e-62a8-4e19-b563-593e9f86a0e6",
          "name": "Submit new Professional Judgement Matrix configuration",
          "request": {
            "name": "Submit new Professional Judgement Matrix configuration",
            "description": {
              "content": "Submit a custom Professional Judgement Matrix configuration. In the response, a unique pjmid for the submitted configuration is returned. The identifier can be used for future retrieval of the custom Professional Judgement Matrix configuration.\n\nFor each consideration, define the risk tolerance score cap for each option. For example,  `“basic knowledge” : 68` means that the suitability score of a client with basic investment knowledge will be capped at 68. Refer to the [Morningstar Risk Profiler Methodology](https://developer.morningstar.com/content/hidden-from-navigation/MorningstarRiskProfilerMethodology_v4.pdf) documentation for further details.\n\nIf a custom Professional Judgement Matrix configuration is not defined, the engine will use the default configuration as defined in the Morningstar Risk Profiler Methodology documentation to calculate the suitability score.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "pjm"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
